# ProctiraERP — always-on (keep short)

## Brand
- Product: **ProctiraERP**. Never CivitasOne / Keycloak chrome in user UI.

## Data boundary (charter §19)
- Schemas: `platform` | `auth` | `institution` | `student` | `attendance` | `assessment` | `examination` | `public` (residual only). Check `schema.prisma` `schemas = […]` if unsure.
- No cross-schema FKs or SQL/`include` joins across domains.
- Cross-domain: bare UUID + HTTP/events only.
- Tenant on owned schemas: bare `tenantId` (no `Tenant @relation`).

## Agent economy (token budget)
- Prefer ripgrep/read over broad explores; touch only files for the ask.
- Do not paste private keys into commits; do not invent EC3 results.
- Prefer pointers to `docs/PHASE_*_SIGNOFF.md` and `docs/specs/` over restating them.
- No drive-by refactors, no unsolicited markdown.
- One job per change; stop when the ask is done.

## School ERP defaults
- India demo tenant seed: `admin@proctira.in` (password only in env/runbooks).
- Multi-tenant isolation is non-negotiable on every write path.
